itle": ""}, {"href": "/service/#service03", "text": "購買意欲を高め、意思決定をスムーズに促進購買意欲を高め、意思決定をスムーズに促進\n\nContents Marketing\nコンテンツマーケティング\n\n\nターゲットの興味やニーズを深く理解し、質の高いコンテンツを企画・制作します。ユーザーの購買意欲を高め、意思決定をスムーズに促進し、効果的な成果をサポートします。", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service/#service04", "text": "集客と成長を包括的に支援し、効率的な成果を追求集客と成長を包括的に支援し、効率的な成果を追求\n\nWEB Marketing\nWEBマーケティング\n\n\n市場やターゲットの分析から戦略の立案、広告運用、効果測定まで、オンラインでの集客と成長を包括的に支援。効率的な成果を追求します。", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service/", "text": "VIEW MORE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://public-function.co.jp/works/z-an/", "text": "VIEW STORY", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://public-function.co.jp/works/z-an/", "text": "PROJECT\n\n                                        14                                        \n\nエイベックス・ミュージック・クリエイティヴ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://public-function.co.jp/works/65/", "text": "VIEW STORY", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://public-function.co.jp/works/65/", "text": "PROJECT\n\n                                        13                                        \n\nJERA × QuizKnock｜ZERO EMISSION SCHOOL", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.nichireifoods.co.jp/", "text": "GO WEBSITE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.nichireifoods.co.jp/", "text": "PROJECT\n\n                                        12                                        \n\nニチレイフーズ", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/works/", "text": "VIEW ALL", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/about/", "text": "VIEW MORE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/recruit/", "text": "VIEW MORE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "https://www.akibasgate.com/", "text": "ANOTHER SIDE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "#", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/contact/", "text": "GET IN TOUCH", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/download/", "text": "DOCUMENTS", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/", "text": "", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/about", "text": "ABOUT", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service", "text": "SERVICE", "alt_title": ""}, {"href": "/service/#service01", "text": "U